":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"அறாஅ","parts":[{"text":"அறாஅ","lemma":"அறாஅ","gloss":"unceasing"}],"gloss":"unceasing","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அரு","parts":[{"text":"அரு","lemma":"அரு","gloss":"rare"}],"gloss":"rare"},{"surface":"நகை","parts":[{"text":"நகை","lemma":"நகை","gloss":"joy"}],"gloss":"joy"},{"surface":"இனிது","parts":[{"text":"இனிது","lemma":"இனிது","gloss":"sweet"}],"gloss":"sweetly"},{"surface":"பெற்று","parts":[{"text":"பெற்று","lemma":"பெற்று","gloss":"having obtained"}],"gloss":"having obtained","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இகும்","parts":[{"text":"இகும்","lemma":"இகும்","gloss":"particle"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"ஏ","parts":[{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"இரும்","parts":[{"text":"இரும்","lemma":"இரும்","gloss":"great"}],"gloss":"great"},{"surface":"குளை","parts":[{"text":"குளை","lemma":"குளை","gloss":"clan"}],"gloss":"clan"},{"surface":"தலைமை","parts":[{"text":"தலைமை","lemma":"தலைமை","gloss":"leadership"}],"gloss":"leadership"},{"surface":"எய்தி","parts":[{"text":"எய்து","lemma":"எய்துதல்","gloss":"attain"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"past participle suffix"}],"gloss":"having attained"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அரும்","parts":[{"text":"அரும்","lemma":"அரும்","gloss":"difficult"}],"gloss":"difficult","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"படர்","parts":[{"text":"படர்","lemma":"படர்","gloss":"grief"}],"gloss":"grief"},{"surface":"எவ்வம்","parts":[{"text":"எவ்வம்","lemma":"எவ்வம்","gloss":"distress"}],"gloss":"distress"},{"surface":"உழந்ததன்","parts":[{"text":"உழந்ததன்","lemma":"உழந்ததன்","gloss":"of having suffered"}],"gloss":"of having suffered","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தலையே","parts":[{"text":"தலை","lemma":"தலை","gloss":"upon"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"upon"}]}],"literal":"Southern fishermen's might to perish / Northern Vadugars' swords having driven away / with well-strung chaplet, perfect spear, and broad hand / swift horses driven, releasing speed, leaving hoof-prints / Chola of the good garlanded toddy, in his palace / like the new crescent moon, plaster-made mansion's / like a cold pond, tall mansion having stood, my / pebble-containing great drum to resound, having beaten / unfailing tradition's victory song to sing / not only those allotted to us, but very many / of excellent glory, rare ornaments and wealth / without withholding, he showered; having seen that / poverty-suffering my great large kinfolk / those who hang on ears what is meant for fingers / and those who wear on fingers what is meant for ears / and those who tie on necks what is meant for waists / like when fierce-anger Rama's united Sita / the strong-natured demon snatched, at that time / reaching the ground, lustrous ornaments which they saw, the monkeys' / red-faced large group wore in confusion, shining / unceasing rare joy sweetly obtained indeed / great clan's leadership having attained / upon having suffered difficult grief and distress.","translation":"The Chola king, who made the might of the southern fishermen perish and drove away the swords of the northern Vadugars, has a broad hand holding a perfect spear and wears a well-strung chaplet. He drives swift horses, leaving hoof-prints on the ground. In his palace, which stands tall like a cold pond with plaster-made mansions resembling the new crescent moon, I stood and beat my pebble-filled great drum to resound, singing the traditional song of victory. He did not just give what was allotted to us, but showered us without withholding with very many rare ornaments and wealth of excellent glory. Seeing that, my large kinfolk, who had suffered long in poverty, began to wear on their ears what was meant for their fingers, and on their fingers what was meant for their ears, and tied around their necks what was meant for their waists! This was just like when the strong demon snatched Sita, who was united with the fiercely angry Rama; the red-faced monkeys of a large group found her lustrous ornaments fallen on the ground and wore them in utter confusion. Thus, my kinfolk obtained sweet, unceasing joy, attaining the leadership of our great clan, putting an end to all the difficult grief and distress they had suffered.","modern":"தெற்கில் உள்ள பரதவர்களின் வலிமை அழியவும், வடக்கில் உள்ள வடுகர்களைத் தன் வாள் வலிமையால் விரட்டியடிக்கவும் செய்தவன் சோழன் இளஞ்சேட்சென்னி. அவன் தொடுக்கப்பட்ட மாலையையும், திருந்திய வேலையும், பெரிய கைகளையும் உடையவன்; விரைந்து செல்லும் குதிரைகளைச் செலுத்தி அவற்றின் குளம்புகளால் தடம் பதிப்பவன். அவனுடைய அரண்மனை, புதிய பிறை நிலவு போன்ற வெண்சுதை பூசப்பட்ட மாடங்களை உடையது; குளிர்ந்த குளத்தைப் போன்ற பெரிய மாளிகையைக் கொண்டது. அங்கு நின்று, என் பரல் கற்கள் நிறைந்த பெரிய கிணைப் பறையை முழக்கி, மரபு தவறாமல் அவனது வஞ்சிப் புகழைப் பாடினேன். அவன் எங்களுக்கு என்று ஒதுக்கிய பரிசில்களைக் காட்டிலும், மிகப்பல சிறந்த அணிகலன்களையும் செல்வங்களையும் வாரி வழங்கினான். அதனைக் கண்ட வறுமையால் வாடிய என் சுற்றத்தினர், விரலில் அணிய வேண்டிய மோதிரங்களைச் செவிகளிலும், செவிகளில் அணிய வேண்டிய குண்டலங்களை விரல்களிலும், அரையில் கட்ட வேண்டிய அணிகளை கழுத்திலும் மாற்றி மாற்றி அணிந்து கொண்டனர். இது, சீதையை இராவணன் கவர்ந்து சென்றபோது, அவள் நிலத்தில் வீசிச் சென்ற ஒளிவீசும் நகைகளைக் கண்டெடுத்த செம்முகக் குரங்குகள், அவற்றை எங்கு அணிவது என்று தெரியாமல் மாற்றி அணிந்து மகிழ்ந்ததைப் போன்றிருந்தது. இவ்வாறு, வறுமையால் துன்புற்ற என் சுற்றத்தார், பெரும் செல்வத்தைப் பெற்றுத் தலைமையை அடைந்து, தங்கள் துன்பங்கள் நீங்கிப் பேரின்பம் எய்தினர்.","explanation":"The poet Ūṉpoti Pacuṅkuṭaiyār sings in praise of the Chola king Iḷañcēṭceṉṉi, who destroyed Serappāḻi. The poet describes how he sang the king's victory songs at his magnificent palace and received an abundance of precious ornaments as gifts. The poet's impoverished relatives are so unfamiliar with luxury that they wear the gifted ornaments on the wrong parts of their bodies. This humorous confusion is compared to the famous Ramayana episode where monkeys find Sita's dropped jewels and wear them haphazardly. Key words include 'kiṇai' (drum), 'vañci' (victory song), 'aruṅkala veṟukkai' (rare ornaments and wealth), and 'kuraṅku' (monkey).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.3],[0.3,0.5],[0.5,1.0],[1.0,1.6],[1.6,1.8],[1.8,2.0],[2.0,2.2],[2.2,2.4],[2.4,3.7],[3.7,4.2],[4.2,4.5],[4.5,4.7],[4.7,5.9],[5.9,6.08],[6.08,6.2],[6.2,6.6],[6.6,6.86],[7.18,8.15],[8.15,8.7],[8.7,9.1],[9.1,9.5],[9.5,10.14],[10.14,10.52],[10.52,11.03],[11.03,11.93],[12.05,12.55],[12.8,13.04],[13.29,13.6],[13.6,14.0],[14.0,14.4],[14.4,14.7],[14.7,15.1],[15.1,15.45],[15.45,15.8],[16.56,17.16],[17.16,17.36],[17.36,17.66],[17.66,17.96],[17.96,18.4],[18.4,18.76],[18.76,19.06],[19.06,19.36],[19.36,19.98],[19.98,20.76],[20.76,21.26],[21.26,21.66],[21.66,22.96],[22.96,23.36],[23.36,23.6],[23.6,23.84],[23.84,23.96],[23.96,25.16],[25.16,25.66],[25.66,26.16],[26.16,26.66],[26.66,27.66],[27.66,28.16],[28.16,28.56],[28.56,28.86],[28.86,30.36],[30.36,30.67],[30.67,31.14],[31.14,31.76],[31.76,32.16],[32.16,32.48],[32.48,33.59],[33.59,34.33],[34.33,35.44],[35.44,35.94],[35.94,36.41],[36.41,36.64],[36.64,37.34],[37.34,38.04],[38.04,38.54],[38.54,38.94],[38.94,39.63],[39.63,40.04],[40.04,40.34],[40.34,40.76],[40.76,41.45],[41.45,42.14],[42.14,42.34],[42.34,42.94],[42.94,43.04],[43.04,43.64],[43.64,44.04],[44.44,44.84],[44.84,45.41],[45.41,45.75],[45.75,46.44],[46.44,46.94],[46.94,47.24],[47.24,48.34],[48.34,48.54],[48.84,49.34],[49.34,49.58]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.8],[1.8,2.0],[2.0,2.2],[2.2,2.4],[2.4,2.7],[2.7,2.98],[2.98,3.83],[3.83,5.1],[5.1,5.6],[5.6,6.6],[6.6,6.78],[6.78,6.9],[6.9,7.3],[7.3,7.56],[7.56,8.0],[8.0,8.36],[8.36,8.62],[8.62,8.89],[8.89,9.33],[9.33,9.6],[9.6,10.0],[10.0,12.5],[12.7,13.1],[13.1,13.51],[13.51,14.2],[14.2,14.5],[14.7,14.93],[14.93,15.5],[15.5,15.9],[15.9,16.3],[16.3,16.7],[17.4,18.0],[18.0,18.3],[18.3,18.6],[18.6,18.9],[18.9,19.57],[19.57,20.1],[20.1,20.4],[20.4,20.8],[20.8,21.51],[21.51,22.4],[22.4,22.8],[22.8,23.3],[23.3,24.7],[24.